d appropriate responses to intracellular calcium signaling (PubMed:27099988, PubMed:31080062, PubMed:32315830, PubMed:33296646)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}